invariant: INV-5
file: webpki_cert.c
catches: webpki_cert_test
reason: read_validity accepts bytes after notAfter inside the Validity
  SEQUENCE, so a certificate carrying a third Time, or one stray byte,
  parses and the two dates no longer fill the field. The Validity
  boundary mutants object.

--- old
    return !v.err && rb_left(&v) == 0 && out->not_before <= out->not_after;
--- new
    return !v.err && out->not_before <= out->not_after;
